{"2255720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Whisperwood Werewolf", "steam_appid": 2255720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whisperwood is a peaceful medieval village, where the villagers are attacked at night by a savage werewolf.  You are Revna of Whisperwood.  Explore vast wilderness to unearth the means to destroy the werewolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talk to Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can talk to characters using your microphone to unlock clues.  This offers a much deeper immersion while playing.  Each character uses an advanced AI system that lets the character role play properly within this medieval story.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can talk to characters about nearly anything you want.  For example, you can ask about which medieval farming practices Whisperwood village uses, and learn more about the three-field system.  You can ask about the villagers, the village, and medieval life in general.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Revna, you wield a large, heavy sword to slash enemies.  You can upgrade this weapon to do more physical damage.  Eventually, you can add elemental damage to your arsenal.  This will include frost, fire, and lightning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whisperwood is a peaceful medieval village, where the villagers are attacked at night by a savage werewolf.  You are Revna of Whisperwood.  Explore vast wilderness to unearth the means to destroy the werewolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talk to Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can talk to characters using your microphone to unlock clues.  This offers a much deeper immersion while playing.  Each character uses an advanced AI system that lets the character role play properly within this medieval story.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can talk to characters about nearly anything you want.  For example, you can ask about which medieval farming practices Whisperwood village uses, and learn more about the three-field system.  You can ask about the villagers, the village, and medieval life in general.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Revna, you wield a large, heavy sword to slash enemies.  You can upgrade this weapon to do more physical damage.  Eventually, you can add elemental damage to your arsenal.  This will include frost, fire, and lightning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Whisperwood Werewolf: open-world action adventure RPG. A villager becomes a night-walking werewolf; as Revna, explore, upgrade, uncover secrets, and hunt it; talk to all characters for clues.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255720/52c6898e78d8305b1f4b8b84a623ca0ab5dbdc0b/header.jpg?t=1784092815", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255720/eb1b83124058263a714706658a937a225d746e3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784092815", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255720/eb1b83124058263a714706658a937a225d746e3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784092815", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2000 series or AMD RX6000 series or newer<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</stron